Action: To read more of the file, you can use the 'offset' and 'limit' parameters in a subsequent 'read_file' call. For example, to read the next section of the file, use offset: 2000.

--- FILE CONTENT (truncated) ---
{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "Start",
      "text": "The tavern door creaks open. Smoke and laughter fill the air.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "TavernEntry",
      "text": "Three figures catch your eye: a hooded stranger, a boisterous merchant, and the barkeep.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "TavernChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "ObserveRoom",
      "text": "You notice the stranger slipping a note to the barkeep. The merchant counts gold nervously.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ObserveChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "InterceptNote",
      "text": "You dare?!",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PickpocketAttempt",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "PickpocketSuccess",
      "text": "50 gold pieces heavier, you slip away. The merchant hasn't noticed... yet.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PickpocketDistract",
      "text": "Watch it, friend!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantAnnoyed",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantCalm",
      "text": "Hmph. Buy me a drink and we're even.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantFight",
      "text": "Why you little\u2014!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PickpocketAfter",
      "text": "But where to spend your ill-gotten gains?",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PickpocketChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerApproach",
      "text": "You have the look of someone seeking something.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerGreet",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonQuestStart",
      "text": "The Crimson Blade? Many seek it. Few survive.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonWarning",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonAccept",
      "text": "Then you'll need a map. I have one... for a price.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonPrice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonNegotiate",
      "text": "100 gold, or a favor to be named later.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonDeal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonGoldPath",
      "text": "Wise choice. No strings attached.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonFavorPath",
      "text": "Remember, I always collect.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonCompromise",
      "text": "You drive a hard bargain. Agreed.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonDiscount",
      "text": "Your silver tongue amuses me. 75 gold, final offer.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonDiscountDeal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonRefuse",
      "text": "Your loss. The Blade waits for no one.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonLore",
      "text": "The mountain claims them. Traps, guardians, madness itself.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CrimsonLoreMore",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "GuardianInfo",
      "text": "Stone sentinels that never sleep. Best approached with stealth... or great power.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GuardianChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "GuardianMagic",
      "text": "A mage, then. You may yet survive. Take this.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GuardianStealth",
      "text": "A rogue's path. Dangerous but possible.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MadnessInfo",
      "text": "The mountain whispers. Those who listen too long... never leave.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MadnessWarning",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MadnessResist",
      "text": "Confidence or foolishness? We shall see.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerLaugh",
      "text": "Ha! I like you. Maybe you'll be the one.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MapReceived",
      "text": "The Crimson Blade awaits at the peak of Mount Sorrow. Go.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MapReceivedDebt",
      "text": "Remember our deal. I will find you when the time is right.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MapReceivedHalf",
      "text": "A fair trade. Now go, before the trail grows cold.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "QuestAccepted",
      "text": "You pocket the map. Your journey begins at dawn.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "QuestAcceptedDebt",
      "text": "The map feels heavy in your hands. What have you agreed to?",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "QuestChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "PrepareQuest",
      "text": "You gather supplies and rest. Dawn breaks cold and clear.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MoreInfo",
      "text": "Who might know more about Mount Sorrow?",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MoreInfoChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepInfo",
      "text": "Mount Sorrow? My grandfather went there once. Came back without his voice. Said he traded it for wisdom.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepWisdom",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepSecret",
      "text": "He wrote it down before he died. Want to see?",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepOffer",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepJournal",
      "text": "It says: \"The silence speaks truth. Listen with your heart, not your ears.\"",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "JournalWisdom",
      "text": "Cryptic, but perhaps useful. You commit it to memory.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepPrice",
      "text": "Smart. 20 gold for the journal.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepDeal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepHaggle",
      "text": "15. Take it or leave it.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepFinal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepTrust",
      "text": "You're kind. Take the journal. He would have wanted it to help someone.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantInfo",
      "text": "Mount Sorrow? I've sold equipment to three expeditions. None returned for refunds.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantSales",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantGear",
      "text": "Climbing tools, wards against magic, and plenty of rope. Most came back for more rope.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GearAdvice",
      "text": "Perhaps you should stock up.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantCynical",
      "text": "Hey, a sale's a sale. Not my fault if they don't come back.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantDefend",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantShame",
      "text": "...I light a candle for each of them. Not that it helps.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantConfess",
      "text": "Look, take this charm. It's supposed to protect against curses. For free. Consider it penance.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CharmReceived",
      "text": "You receive a strange amulet. It pulses faintly with warmth.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantShop",
      "text": "I've got rope, torches, climbing picks, and a potion or two. What'll it be?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ShopChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BuyGear",
      "text": "30 gold for the full kit. Worth every copper.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GearPurchase",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "GearBought",
      "text": "You're now equipped for climbing. The mountain won't know what hit it.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GearHaggle",
      "text": "25, and that's robbery.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GearFinal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "PotionList",
      "text": "Healing, night vision, and one I call \"liquid courage.\" Makes you immune to fear for an hour.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PotionChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BuyHealing",
      "text": "A red vial joins your pack. Better than dying.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BuyNightVision",
      "text": "A blue vial. The darkness won't hide dangers from you now.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BuyCourage",
      "text": "A golden vial. For when fear is the enemy.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BuyAll",
      "text": "Big spender! 60 gold for the lot.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BuyAllDeal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "AllPotionsBought",
      "text": "Your pack clinks with vials. You feel prepared.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerMoreInfo",
      "text": "Back so soon? Afraid?",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerReturn",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerRespect",
      "text": "Wisdom. Most charge in blindly. Ask your questions.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerQuestions",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerOrigin",
      "text": "I... found it. On someone who no longer needed it.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerDark",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerAccuse",
      "text": "Would it matter? They're dead. The map lives on. As might you.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerClarity",
      "text": "The mountain took them. I merely... recovered what was left.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerPast",
      "text": "Once. Long ago. I left something there. Something I can never retrieve.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerRegret",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerSecret",
      "text": "My name. The mountain takes something from everyone.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerVulnerable",
      "text": "...Her name was Elena. She heard the whispers and... walked off the cliff. Smiling.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerGrief",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerHope",
      "text": "The legends say it can cut anything. Even death. But legends lie.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerBlessing",
      "text": "Go then. And may you find what you seek... without losing what you have.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerWarningFinal",
      "text": "Guard your identity. The mountain will try to take it.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerTruth",
      "text": "Power. Madness. Death. And one blade that can end wars or start them.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RecruitChoice",
      "text": "Who might join your quest?",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RecruitOptions",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "RecruitStranger",
      "text": "Join you? I gave up adventuring when Elena... No. But I'll wait here. If you return, drinks are on me.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RecruitFail",
      "text": "Your party remains at one. Perhaps for the best.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RecruitMerchant",
      "text": "Me? Climb a mountain? Ha! I'll sell you supplies, but I like living too much.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RecruitBarkeep",
      "text": "I know a sellsword who comes through sometimes. Name's Kira. She's... intense.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraIntro",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraLocation",
      "text": "She's in the back room. Blue cloak, two swords. Can't miss her.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraRate",
      "text": "She negotiates. Bring coin and patience.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraWarning",
      "text": "She's never failed a contract. But she's got... rules. Strange ones. Don't break them.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraMeet",
      "text": "You find Kira sharpening her blade in the dim light.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraApproach",
      "text": "State your business. I don't do small talk.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraOffer",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraJob",
      "text": "Mountain? Which one?",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraWhich",
      "text": "Mount Sorrow?",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraSorrow",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraKnows",
      "text": "Everyone's heard of it. Not everyone's stupid enough to go.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraConcern",
      "text": "Problem? It's suicide. But the pay would need to match.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraPrice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraNaming",
      "text": "200 gold. Half now, half when we're done. If we survive, you owe me a story.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraDeal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraJoins",
      "text": "Then we leave at dawn. Don't be late. I won't wait.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraHaggle",
      "text": "175. And you carry the supplies.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraHaggleFinal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraGlory",
      "text": "Glory doesn't pay for food. But... the Crimson Blade is legendary. 150 gold.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraFlattery",
      "text": "Flattery is cheap. What do you want?",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraDirect",
      "text": "Depends on the threat. Mount Sorrow? That's 200 gold minimum.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraDecision",
      "text": "If you're going to Sorrow, you'll need me. 200 gold. Take it or leave it.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PartyFormed",
      "text": "With Kira at your side, the odds feel slightly less suicidal.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantApproach",
      "text": "Ah, a customer perhaps? Or just looking for company?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantGreet",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantTrouble",
      "text": "It's nothing. Just... debts. Powerful people. You know how it is.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantDebt",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantAmount",
      "text": "500 gold. By month's end, or...",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantThreat",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantHelp",
      "text": "What kind of price?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantBargain",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantDeal",
      "text": "Everything? I... alright. Save me and it's yours.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantInfoDeal",
      "text": "Information? I know expeditions. Gear lists. Who came back. It's yours if you help.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantPartner",
      "text": "A partner? That's... actually fair. You help with this, and we split future profits. Deal?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantAllied",
      "text": "You've gained a potential ally\u2014or liability. Time will tell.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantHit",
      "text": "You're... offering to kill them? That's dark. But effective. 100 gold if you do.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitAccepted",
      "text": "You've accepted a contract to kill. This will have consequences.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitNegotiate",
      "text": "150. That's all I have left.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitFinal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantCreditor",
      "text": "A guild. The Black Ledger. They don't forgive debts.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantSuspicious",
      "text": "It's just gold! Honestly earned! Why would you\u2014are you with THEM?!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantPanic",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantTerror",
      "text": "Please! I can pay! I just need more time!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantBeg",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantRelief",
      "text": "Oh thank the gods. You nearly gave me a heart attack. Drinks on me.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantBribed",
      "text": "Anything! Ask and it's yours!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantFate",
      "text": "The merchant's scream is cut short. The tavern falls silent.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantFriendly",
      "text": "You're alright, friend. Let me know if you need gear or trade contacts.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepApproach",
      "text": "What'll it be? Ale, wine, or something stronger?",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkAle",
      "text": "Classic choice. 2 copper.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkWine",
      "text": "From the southern vineyards. 5 copper.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkStrong",
      "text": "Dwarven Fire. You sure? It's knocked out knights.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrongConfirm",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkDouble",
      "text": "Your funeral.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkPassed",
      "text": "The world spins. Then goes dark. You wake up in an alley, missing 50 gold.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RobbedWake",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlleyRage",
      "text": "Your shout echoes. A rat scurries away. No answers come.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlleyCheck",
      "text": "Your pack is intact. The map is still there. But your coin pouch is lighter.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlleyCalm",
      "text": "You take stock. Gold gone, but otherwise unharmed. Could be worse.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "TavernReturn",
      "text": "You stumble back to the tavern. The barkeep smirks.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepSmirk",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepAccuse",
      "text": "I told you Dwarven Fire knocks out knights. Not my fault you didn't listen.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepLaugh",
      "text": "Ha! You've got spirit. This one's on the house.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkServed",
      "text": "The drink warms your belly. The world feels slightly better.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepBribe",
      "text": "Information costs. 20 gold and I'll tell you what I know about the castle nearby.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerHostile",
      "text": "You've made a dangerous enemy today.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerFight",
      "text": "Blades flash. The stranger is fast\u2014too fast.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerBattle",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerWound",
      "text": "You land a cut, but so does she. Blood drips from both of you.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerStalemate",
      "text": "Enough. You fight well. Perhaps we started poorly.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerTruce",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerExplain",
      "text": "I test potential allies. You passed.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerMercy",
      "text": "Coward. But at least you're smart. Leave my sight.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerCalm",
      "text": "Words are wind. But I'll give you one chance. Explain yourself.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerExplain2",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerNote",
      "text": "The note is none of your concern. But since you're bold...",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerLie",
      "text": "[Narrows eyes] You're lying. But I appreciate the attempt.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerReveal",
      "text": "Perceptive. I was once known as the Shadow of Eloria. Now I am no one.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerIdentity",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerFamous",
      "text": "Former. Retired. Mostly.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerPurpose",
      "text": "Waiting. For someone like you, perhaps.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerOffended",
      "text": "Good. That means I did my job well.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkOffer",
      "text": "Work? I have a task. Dangerous. Well-paid. Interested?",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkDetails",
      "text": "Retrieve an item from the old crypt. A ring. Don't ask what it does.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkRisk",
      "text": "Undead. Traps. The usual.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkPay",
      "text": "100 gold on completion. More if you're fast.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkAccept",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "SideQuestAccepted",
      "text": "Good. Come back when it's done. Don't die.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFight",
      "text": "Tables overturn! The tavern erupts into chaos!",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightWin",
      "text": "Fists fly. You emerge victorious, bruised but alive.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightHide",
      "text": "Chaos swirls above as you wait it out. Eventually, calm returns.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightAfter",
      "text": "OUT! All of you! I'm closing early!",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "TavernExit",
      "text": "The cool night air greets you. The adventure continues... elsewhere.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "JourneyBegin",
      "text": "The mountain looms in the distance. Your destiny awaits.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    }
